  "Q00692_HowtoOpposeEvil/32550-01.htm": {
   "file": "Q00692_HowtoOpposeEvil/32550-01.htm",
   "quest": 692,
   "text": "Kutran: Would you like to know about the Special Seed Products ? They are a type of crystal that contains each Seed's power and characteristics: the source of the evil power that has reduced Gracia to this pitiful state. Despite the danger, however, there is no doubt that this same energy could gre…",
   "header": "Kutran",
   "when": [
    "cond 2"
   ],
   "links": [
    {
     "text": "Keep listening.",
     "bypass": "Quest Q00692_HowtoOpposeEvil 32550-02.htm",
     "kind": "quest-event",
     "script": "Q00692_HowtoOpposeEvil",
     "event": "32550-02.htm",
     "quest": 692,
     "to": "Q00692_HowtoOpposeEvil/32550-02.htm"
    }
   ]
  },
  "Q00692_HowtoOpposeEvil/32550-05.htm": {
   "file": "Q00692_HowtoOpposeEvil/32550-05.htm",
   "quest": 692,
   "text": "Kirklan: Well...what brings you here?",
   "header": "Kirklan",
   "when": [
    "cond 3"
   ],
   "links": [
    {
     "text": "Exchange Special Seed Product of Seed of Infinity or Collection reward.",
     "bypass": "Quest Q00692_HowtoOpposeEvil 32550-06.htm",
     "kind": "quest-event",
     "script": "Q00692_HowtoOpposeEvil",
     "event": "32550-06.htm",
     "quest": 692,
     "to": "Q00692_HowtoOpposeEvil/32550-06.htm"
    },
    {
     "text": "Exchange Special Seed Product of Seed of Destruction or Collection reward.",
     "bypass": "Quest Q00692_HowtoOpposeEvil 32550-11.htm",
     "kind": "quest-event",
     "script": "Q00692_HowtoOpposeEvil",
     "event": "32550-11.htm",
     "quest": 692,
     "to": "Q00692_HowtoOpposeEvil/32550-11.htm"
    },
    {
     "text": "Exchange Special Seed Product of Seed of Extermination or Collection reward.",
     "bypass": "Quest Q00692_HowtoOpposeEvil 32550-16.htm",
     "kind": "quest-event",
     "script": "Q00692_HowtoOpposeEvil",
     "event": "32550-16.htm",
     "quest": 692,
     "to": "Q00692_HowtoOpposeEvil/32550-16.htm"
    },
    {
     "text": "Say you will continue your mission.",
     "bypass": "Quest Q00692_HowtoOpposeEvil 32550-21.htm",
     "kind": "quest-event",
     "script": "Q00692_HowtoOpposeEvil",
     "event": "32550-21.htm",
     "quest": 692,
     "to": "Q00692_HowtoOpposeEvil/32550-21.htm"
    }
   ]
  },
  "Q00692_HowtoOpposeEvil/32550-04.htm": {
   "file": "Q00692_HowtoOpposeEvil/32550-04.htm",
   "quest": 692,
   "text": "Kutran: These exchanges can benefit both of us. Let me recap: 5 Nuclei of an Incomplete Soul from the Seed of Immortality can be exchanged for 1 Nucleus of a Freed Soul , 5 Mounted Troop Totems from the Seed of Destruction can be exchanged for 1 Mounted Troop Charm , 5 Spirit Stone Dust from the Se…",
   "header": "Kutran",
   "when": [
    "cond 3"
   ],
   "sets": {
    "cond": "3"
   },
   "outcome": "cond",
   "links": []
  },
  "Q00692_HowtoOpposeEvil/32550-02.htm": {
   "file": "Q00692_HowtoOpposeEvil/32550-02.htm",
   "quest": 692,
   "text": "Kutran: These Special Seed Products may give us the edge we need to defeat our enemies. If you acquire the materials we need from the monsters of each Seed, I can process them. Then I'll exchange them for Special Seed Products. You passed Dilis' test, so I suppose I can tell you exchange list: 5 Nu…",
   "header": "Kutran",
   "links": [
    {
     "text": "Keep listening.",
     "bypass": "Quest Q00692_HowtoOpposeEvil 32550-03.htm",
     "kind": "quest-event",
     "script": "Q00692_HowtoOpposeEvil",
     "event": "32550-03.htm",
     "quest": 692,
     "to": "Q00692_HowtoOpposeEvil/32550-03.htm"
    }
   ]
  },
  "Q00692_HowtoOpposeEvil/32550-03.htm": {
   "file": "Q00692_HowtoOpposeEvil/32550-03.htm",
   "quest": 692,
   "text": "Kutran: You also need to know about the Seed Collection . There are specific periods available for collection depending upon each Seed's cycle. Since what you collect can usually be used as ingredients in my work, I'll give you Adena when you gather and bring any of the following: Fragment of Soul …",
   "header": "Kutran",
   "links": [
    {
     "text": "Listen to his explanation again.",
     "bypass": "Quest Q00692_HowtoOpposeEvil 32550-01.htm",
     "kind": "quest-event",
     "script": "Q00692_HowtoOpposeEvil",
     "event": "32550-01.htm",
     "quest": 692,
     "to": "Q00692_HowtoOpposeEvil/32550-01.htm"
    },
    {
     "text": "Say you understand.",
     "bypass": "Quest Q00692_HowtoOpposeEvil 32550-04.htm",
     "kind": "quest-event",
     "script": "Q00692_HowtoOpposeEvil",
     "event": "32550-04.htm",
     "quest": 692,
     "to": "Q00692_HowtoOpposeEvil/32550-04.htm",
     "effect": "cond:3"
    }
   ]
  },
